plete network asserted.","Recover axes and scientifically justify branch gates before measuring lengths.","Keep upstream and downstream transport budgets separate; no sum over graph edges.","Review original processing and observation gaps before new derived dimensions."],"schema":"osw.current-source-scope-audit.v1","source_access":"Publisher Introduction paragraphs 3–8, Tables 1–2 and section 2.2 read; no figure, field or transport time-series digitized.","source_locator":"Introduction paragraphs 3–4; Tables 1–2; section 2.2.","source_time_caution":"Abstract mentions January 2003; Table 1 explicitly reports 2004–2006 averages. Individual mooring deployment dates differ, including an August 2003 Ombai deployment. Preserve these distinctions.","source_url":"https://agupubs.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/full/10.1029/2008JC005257","status":"source_supported_conceptual_network_not_scientific_taxonomy_admission","summary":"Selected western/eastern inflow and three main exit pathways represented as twelve conceptual nodes and fourteen connections. Three exit transport means retain 2004–2006 support, processing-choice intervals and eight published first-deployment mooring positions. No geographic network edges, full system length, current width, annual extrema or instantaneous one-way-flow claim.","whole_current_length_km":null,"whole_current_width_km":null},{"aliases_resolved":false,"annual_width_range_km":null,"basis_object_sha256":"6f438c549817bd4f0099f727b6244b62fc99ad4a9607e1f3ed1bc89f655e360e","current_id":"indonesian-throughflow","figure":"figures/current-measurement-scopes/indonesian-throughflow.svg","figure_alt":"Measure each passage with explicit depth, period and boundary rules. Channel and transport-integration spans are not current-width boundaries. Relationships only; member measurements are not inherited.","generator_file":"analysis/build_current_measurement_scopes.py","generator_sha256":"1357a690e4780eff266db7e95c1998498df88f1e76fdff570b2676d78528534f","member