h from the 35 W section near 3 S to an OSW truncation near 10 W, 4.3 S. Uses the published float-study domain, not full-current start and termination. Excludes westward SEC legs, NBUC source pathways, recirculation loops, surface drift and uncertain central/eastern continuation.","source_locator":"Section 2 [6]–[7] and Fig. 1: floats parked at 200 m; 174 ten-day zonal-flow estimates within 3–6 S, 35 W to approximately 10 W. Section 4 [9]: mean core around 3 S at 35 W and slightly south of 4 S farther east. Sections 5–6: western meanders and unresolved layer-dependent connectivity.","source_url":"https://agupubs.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/full/10.1029/2008GL035753","status":"editorial_reference_path_candidate_not_scientifically_reviewed","supporting_sources":[]},{"approximate_reference_path_km":2800,"candidate_file":"research/caribbean-reference-path-candidate.json","candidate_sha256":"4e789ede7b3fc286647d495a2b0ea8fa7bb9d2cb18fd1d9554c258289c7fb784","comparison_group":"osw_approximate_reference_routes","current_id":"caribbean","figure":"figures/caribbean-reference-path-candidate.svg","generator_sha256":"1362693ec7075e014d065691923248db455a5c3cd78c9a94880b3b472594d240","id":"caribbean-reference-path-candidate","name":"Caribbean Current","nominal_atlas_state_crossings":["CAMR","CARB"],"ordering_sensitivity":{"envelope_position_bounds":[5,11],"interpretation":"Conservative positions within retained rounded route envelopes, treating choices independently; touching envelopes overlap. Not a statistical rank interval or a uniform whole-current comparison.","overlapping_candidate_ids":["brazil-reference-path-candidate","leeuwin-reference-path-candidate","east-greenland-reference-path-candidate","benguela-reference-path-candidate","north-brazil-reference-path-candidate","hiri-reference-path-candidate"]},"parent_current_id":null,"parent_scope_note":null,"recommended_nasa_tile_id":"level2_B_3","remaining_gates":["Scientific review of naming limits, layer and regional gate conventions.","Verify bathymetric and velocity correspondence; coarse land clearance does not establish a current axis.","Canonical admission and publication review; retain regional scope and editorial provenance."],"route_extent_kind":"Caribbean regional corridor","scenario_count":54,"scenario_range_km":[2500,2800],"scope":"Selected westward Caribbean regional route from a Windward Islands approach to the Belize/Yucatan transition near 19 N. Excludes the northward Yucatan Current, Loop and Florida currents, additional island entry branches, Colombia-Panama gyre circuits and eddy perimeters. No unique continuous axis or whole-system length asserted.","source_locator":"Centurioni and Niiler (2003), sections 1-3 paragraphs 2, 4, 6-9 and section 4 paragraph 12: westward basins, Jamaica Ridge jets and transition into Yucatan Current; eddy-dominated mean-flow limitations.","source_url":"https://agupubs.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/full/10.1029/2002GL016231","status":"editorial_reference_path_candidate_not_scientifically_reviewed","supporting_sources":[]},{"approximate_reference_path_km":2700,"candidate_file":"research/east-greenland-reference-path-candidate.json","candidate_sha256":"979276f0e273536cf7ced30367a900466dec1d5a1905b013d1d61017b483ceb5","comparison_group":"osw_approximate_reference_routes","current_id":"east-greenland","figure":"figures/east-greenland-reference-path-candidate.svg","generator_sha256":"1362693ec7075e014d065691923248db455a5c3cd78c9a94880b3b472594d240","id":"east-greenland-reference-path-candidate","name":"East Greenland Current","nominal_atlas_state_crossings":["ARCT","SARC"],"ordering_sensitivity":{"envelope_position_bounds":[5,11],"interpretation":"Conservative positions within retained rounded route envelopes, treating choices independently; touching envelopes overlap. Not a statistical rank interval or a uniform whole-current comparison.","overlapping_candidate_ids":["brazil-reference-path-candidate","leeuwin-reference-path-candidate","caribbean-